        "functionality": "Implements decode, write, readback, and shadowing for the control/status register bank. Produces semantic configuration fields and a clear_sticky_faults pulse/level field for the controller, and accepts shadow/status fields to make them readable by firmware. Only registers that are explicitly reachable via address decode are exposed.",
