          "Store control and configuration values visible to firmware.",
          "Return live status and shadowed applied/accepted command values on reads.",
          "Expose a clean semantic control interface for the controller.",
          "Support sticky fault clear by explicit software action.",
          "Maintain no inaccessible software-visible state."
