        "reset_behavior": "Resets all writable configuration registers to safe defaults, clears sticky faults, and returns readback to default values until firmware programs settings. Ready/valid outputs idle low or high-safe as appropriate.",
        "behavior_rules": [
          "Every declared register must be reachable through RTL decode.",
          "Host writes may update only implemented fields and only at legal addresses.",
          "Read data must reflect shadowed applied/accepted values and live sticky status.",
          "Clear control must explicitly clear sticky faults when written by software.",
          "No large payload storage is implemented in registers."
